<!-- ── Reference Genomes ── -->
<section id="genomes">
  <span class="sec-tag">// Reference genomes</span>
  <h2 class="sec-title">Reference Genomes</h2>
  <p class="sec-sub">{{ genomes | length }} species with genome sequence and gene annotation on disk, and transcript sequences for 11 of them. For human, a BWA index is built, and the Cell Ranger 2024-A reference is ready to use and includes its own STAR index. For mouse, the Cell Ranger 2024-A reference is on disk but not yet extracted. One or more of STAR, BWA and Bowtie2 indexes also exist for 10 other species.</p>
  <div class="genomes-wrap">
    <table class="genomes-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Species</th>
          <th>Common Name</th>
          <th>Assemblies</th>
          <th>Annotation</th>
          <th>Use Cases</th>
          <th>On disk</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
{%- for genome in genomes %}
        <tr>
          <td><span class="genome-species">{{ genome.species }}</span></td>
          <td><span class="genome-common">{{ genome.commonName }}</span></td>
          <td><span class="genome-asm">{{ genome.assemblies }}</span></td>
          <td>{{ genome.annotation }}</td>
          <td>{{ genome.useCases }}</td>
          <td>{% for asset in genome.onDisk %}{% if asset.index %}<span class="idx-badge idx-on">{{ asset.index }}</span>{% else %}<span class="idx-badge idx-file">{{ asset.file }}</span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</td>
        </tr>
{%- endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <div class="genome-legend">
    <span><span class="idx-badge idx-on">STAR</span> Prepared index, ready to use</span>
    <span><span class="idx-badge idx-file">GTF</span> Sequence or annotation file</span>
  </div>
  <p class="genome-note">Inventory of local reference storage, measured 19 Sep 2026; human, mouse and rat rows rechecked 13 Nov 2026. <a href="https://control.omnibioai.org" target="_blank">Live status on the platform dashboard ↗</a> · <a href="https://docs.omnibioai.org/reference-data/organism-assets/" target="_blank">Full inventory in the docs ↗</a></p>
</section>
